{"version":1,"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-5","asignatura":"matematicas","anio":2008,"convocatoria":"Reserva 5","documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_5.pdf","ejercicios":[{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-5-1","n":1,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea \\(f:[0,2\\pi]\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=e^x(\\mathrm{sen}\\,x+\\cos x)\\).","apartados":["(1,25 p.) Determina los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(f\\).","(1,25 p.) Calcula los puntos de inflexión de la gráfica de \\(f\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>El dominio es \\([0,2\\pi]\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Rayamos la parte de la recta que queda fuera del dominio: ahí la función no está definida y no se estudia.</i>. Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>:</p>\\[f'(x)=e^x(\\mathrm{sen}\\,x+\\cos x)+e^x(\\cos x-\\mathrm{sen}\\,x)=2e^x\\cos x=0\\iff\\boxed{x=\\frac\\pi2},\\ \\boxed{x=\\frac{3\\pi}2}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 302 108' width='100%' style='max-width:362px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H288' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M264 56L268 48M268 56L272 48M272 56L276 48M276 56L280 48M280 56L284 48M284 56L288 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>π/2</text><path d='M188 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='188' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>3π/2</text><path d='M262 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='262' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2π</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M65.0 40L101.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 11L101.0 10L99.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(π/4) &gt; 0</text><text x='125.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M139.0 10L175.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M166.0 39L175.0 40L173.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='151.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(π) &lt; 0</text><text x='199.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M213.0 40L249.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M240.0 11L249.0 10L247.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='225.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(7π/4) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f\\) crece en \\(\\left(0,\\frac\\pi2\\right)\\) y \\(\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}2,2\\pi\\right)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\), y decrece en \\(\\left(\\frac\\pi2,\\frac{3\\pi}2\\right)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>.</p><div class='res'>Crece en \\(\\left(0,\\frac\\pi2\\right)\\cup\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}2,2\\pi\\right)\\); decrece en \\(\\left(\\frac\\pi2,\\frac{3\\pi}2\\right)\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[f''(x)=2e^x\\cos x-2e^x\\,\\mathrm{sen}\\,x=2e^x(\\cos x-\\mathrm{sen}\\,x)=0\\iff\\mathrm{tg}\\,x=1\\iff x=\\frac\\pi4,\\ \\frac{5\\pi}4\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 302 108' width='100%' style='max-width:362px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H288' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M264 56L268 48M268 56L272 48M272 56L276 48M276 56L280 48M280 56L284 48M284 56L288 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>π/4</text><path d='M188 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='188' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>5π/4</text><path d='M262 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='262' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2π</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M73.0 12Q89.0 48 105.0 12' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>″(0,1) &gt; 0</text><text x='125.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M147.0 40Q163.0 4 179.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none'/><text x='151.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>″(π/2) &lt; 0</text><text x='199.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M221.0 12Q237.0 48 253.0 12' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none'/><text x='225.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>″(3π/2) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f''\\) cambia de signo en ambos. \\(f\\left(\\frac\\pi4\\right)=e^{\\pi/4}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt2}2+\\frac{\\sqrt2}2\\right)=\\sqrt2\\,e^{\\pi/4}\\) y \\(f\\left(\\frac{5\\pi}4\\right)=-\\sqrt2\\,e^{5\\pi/4}\\).</p><div class='res'>Puntos de inflexión \\(\\left(\\frac\\pi4,\\sqrt2\\,e^{\\pi/4}\\right)\\) y \\(\\left(\\frac{5\\pi}4,-\\sqrt2\\,e^{5\\pi/4}\\right)\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"mono","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"curv","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_5.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-5-2","n":2,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sean \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) y \\(g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) las funciones dadas por \\(f(x)=x^2\\) y \\(g(x)=a\\) (con \\(a\\gt0\\)). Se sabe que el área del recinto limitado por las gráficas de las funciones \\(f\\) y \\(g\\) es \\(\\frac43\\). Calcula el valor de la constante \\(a\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Cortes: \\(x^2=a\\iff x=\\pm\\sqrt a\\). Entre ellos la recta \\(y=a\\) va por encima (dibujo con \\(a=1\\)):</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 180' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='77.8,87.2 81.4,87.2 85.0,87.2 88.6,87.2 92.2,87.2 95.8,87.2 99.4,87.2 103.1,87.2 106.7,87.2 110.3,87.2 113.9,87.2 117.5,87.2 121.1,87.2 124.7,87.2 128.3,87.2 131.9,87.2 135.6,87.2 139.2,87.2 142.8,87.2 146.4,87.2 150.0,87.2 153.6,87.2 157.2,87.2 160.8,87.2 164.4,87.2 168.1,87.2 171.7,87.2 175.3,87.2 178.9,87.2 182.5,87.2 186.1,87.2 189.7,87.2 193.3,87.2 196.9,87.2 200.6,87.2 204.2,87.2 207.8,87.2 211.4,87.2 215.0,87.2 218.6,87.2 222.2,87.2 222.2,87.2 218.6,92.7 215.0,97.8 211.4,102.7 207.8,107.4 204.2,111.7 200.6,115.8 196.9,119.5 193.3,123.0 189.7,126.3 186.1,129.2 182.5,131.9 178.9,134.2 175.3,136.3 171.7,138.2 168.1,139.7 164.4,141.0 160.8,141.9 157.2,142.6 153.6,143.1 150.0,143.2 146.4,143.1 142.8,142.6 139.2,141.9 135.6,141.0 131.9,139.7 128.3,138.2 124.7,136.3 121.1,134.2 117.5,131.9 113.9,129.2 110.3,126.3 106.7,123.0 103.1,119.5 99.4,115.8 95.8,111.7 92.2,107.4 88.6,102.7 85.0,97.8 81.4,92.7 77.8,87.2' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='45.3,25.5 48.8,33.2 52.3,40.6 55.8,47.8 59.2,54.8 62.7,61.4 66.2,67.8 69.7,74.0 73.2,79.9 76.7,85.5 80.2,90.9 83.7,96.0 87.2,100.8 90.7,105.4 94.1,109.7 97.6,113.8 101.1,117.6 104.6,121.1 108.1,124.4 111.6,127.4 115.1,130.1 118.6,132.6 122.1,134.8 125.6,136.8 129.1,138.5 132.5,139.9 136.0,141.1 139.5,142.0 143.0,142.7 146.5,143.1 150.0,143.2 153.5,143.1 157.0,142.7 160.5,142.0 164.0,141.1 167.5,139.9 170.9,138.5 174.4,136.8 177.9,134.8 181.4,132.6 184.9,130.1 188.4,127.4 191.9,124.4 195.4,121.1 198.9,117.6 202.4,113.8 205.9,109.7 209.3,105.4 212.8,100.8 216.3,96.0 219.8,90.9 223.3,85.5 226.8,79.9 230.3,74.0 233.8,67.8 237.3,61.4 240.8,54.8 244.2,47.8 247.7,40.6 251.2,33.2 254.7,25.5' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,87.2 150.0,87.2 280.0,87.2' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='77.8' cy='87.2' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='27.8' y='81.2'>(−√a,a)</text><circle cx='222.2' cy='87.2' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='228.2' y='81.2'>(√a,a)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 143.2H294.0M150.0 174.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='77.8' y1='140.2' x2='77.8' y2='146.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='74.8' y='157.2' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='222.2' y1='140.2' x2='222.2' y2='146.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='219.2' y='157.2' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='147.0' y1='87.2' x2='153.0' y2='87.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='91.2' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div>\\[A=\\int_{-\\sqrt a}^{\\sqrt a}(a-x^2)\\,dx=\\Bigl[ax-\\frac{x^3}3\\Bigr]_{-\\sqrt a}^{\\sqrt a}=2\\left(a\\sqrt a-\\frac{a\\sqrt a}3\\right)=\\frac43a\\sqrt a\\]\\[\\frac43a^{3/2}=\\frac43\\iff a^{3/2}=1\\iff a=1\\]<div class='res'>\\(a=1\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_5.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-5-3","n":3,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea \\(I\\) la matriz identidad de orden 3 y \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1&-2\\\\-1&0&-2\\\\1&1&3\\end{pmatrix}\\). Calcula, si existe, el valor de \\(k\\) para el cual \\((A-kI)^2\\) es la matriz nula.","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Como \\(A\\) e \\(I\\) conmutan, \\((A-kI)^2=A^2-2kA+k^2I\\).</p>\\[A^2=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & -1 & -2\\\\-1 & 0 & -2\\\\1 & 1 & 3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0 & -1 & -2\\\\-1 & 0 & -2\\\\1 & 1 & 3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1 & -2 & -4\\\\-2 & -1 & -4\\\\2 & 2 & 5\\end{pmatrix}\\]<p>Miro un elemento de fuera de la diagonal, el \\((1,2)\\): \\(-2-2k(-1)+0=2k-2=0\\iff k=1\\). Compruebo que con \\(k=1\\) se anula toda la matriz:</p>\\[A-I=\\begin{pmatrix}-1 & -1 & -2\\\\-1 & -1 & -2\\\\1 & 1 & 2\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad(A-I)^2=\\begin{pmatrix}-1 & -1 & -2\\\\-1 & -1 & -2\\\\1 & 1 & 2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-1 & -1 & -2\\\\-1 & -1 & -2\\\\1 & 1 & 2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>Existe: \\(k=1\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"ops","apartados":""},{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"pot","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_5.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-5-4","n":4,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Se sabe que los planos de ecuaciones \\(x+2y+bz=1\\), \\(2x+y+bz=0\\), \\(3x+3y-2z=1\\) se cortan en una recta \\(r\\).","apartados":["(1,25 p.) Calcula el valor de \\(b\\).","(1,25 p.) Halla unas ecuaciones paramétricas de \\(r\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Los tres planos se cortan en una recta si el sistema que forman es compatible indeterminado con \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. Hace falta \\(|A|=0\\). Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&2&b\\\\2&1&b\\\\3&3&-2\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(-2+6 b+6 b\\bigr)-\\bigl(3 b+3 b-8\\bigr)\\]\\[=6b+6=6(b+1)\\]<p>\\(b=-1\\). Comprobación: con \\(b=-1\\) la 3.ª ecuación \\(3x+3y-2z=1\\) es la suma de las dos primeras (\\(x+2y-z=1\\), \\(2x+y-z=0\\)), y \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&2\\\\2&1\\end{vmatrix}=-3\\neq0\\): rango 2 en las dos matrices ✓.</p><div class='res'>\\(b=-1\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(x+2y=1+z\\), \\(2x+y=z\\). Restando la 1.ª al doble de la 2.ª: \\(3x=z-1\\). Tomando \\(z=1+3t\\): \\(x=t\\), y de la 2.ª, \\(y=z-2x=1+t\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(r\\equiv(t,\\ 1+t,\\ 1+3t)\\), \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"pos","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"disc","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"ecs","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_5.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-5-5","n":5,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=\\begin{cases}x\\,|x|&\\text{si }x\\leq2\\\\6-x&\\text{si }x\\gt2\\end{cases}\\)","apartados":["(0,75 p.) Esboza la gráfica de \\(f\\).","(1 p.) Estudia la derivabilidad de \\(f\\).","(0,75 p.) Calcula el área comprendida entre la gráfica de \\(f\\) y el eje de abscisas."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":