roke='currentColor'/><text x='70.4' y='42.6' font-size='10'>4</text></svg></div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Fuera de \\(x=0\\) y \\(x=2\\), \\(f\\) es derivable (polinomios).</p><p><b>En </b>\\(x=0\\)<b>:</b> continua (\\(0\\) por ambos lados); \\(f'(0^-)=-2x\\big|_0=0\\), \\(f'(0^+)=2x\\big|_0=0\\). Derivable, \\(f'(0)=0\\).</p><p><b>En </b>\\(x=2\\)<b>:</b> continua (\\(\\lim_{x\\to2^-}x^2=4=\\lim_{x\\to2^+}(6-x)\\)); \\(f'(2^-)=4\\), \\(f'(2^+)=-1\\). No derivable (punto anguloso).</p><div class='res'>\\(f\\) es derivable en \\(\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{2\\}\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado c","html":"<div class='ex'><p>El recinto limitado por la gráfica y el eje va de \\(x=0\\) a \\(x=6\\) (para \\(x\\lt0\\) la gráfica no vuelve a cortar al eje y no encierra recinto):</p>\\[A=\\int_0^2x^2\\,dx+\\int_2^6(6-x)\\,dx=\\frac83+\\Bigl[6x-\\frac{x^2}2\\Bigr]_2^6=\\frac83+(18-10)=\\frac{32}3\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{32}3\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"rep","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"cont","apartados":"b"},{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":"c"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_5.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-5-6","n":6,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Calcula \\(\\displaystyle\\int_1^ex^2\\ln(x)\\,dx\\) (\\(\\ln\\) denota la función logaritmo neperiano).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Por partes<i class='n' data-t='th'>Integración por partes: \\(\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du\\).</i>, con \\(u=\\ln x\\), \\(dv=x^2\\,dx\\): \\(du=\\frac{dx}x\\), \\(v=\\frac{x^3}3\\).</p>\\[\\int x^2\\ln x\\,dx=\\frac{x^3}3\\ln x-\\int\\frac{x^2}3\\,dx=\\frac{x^3}3\\ln x-\\frac{x^3}9\\]\\[\\int_1^ex^2\\ln x\\,dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{x^3}3\\ln x-\\frac{x^3}9\\Bigr]_1^e=\\frac{e^3}3-\\frac{e^3}9-\\left(0-\\frac19\\right)=\\frac{2e^3+1}9\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\dfrac{2e^3+1}9\\approx4{,}57\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"part","apartados":""},{"tema":"integ","tipo":"def","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_5.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-5-7","n":7,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Dadas las matrices \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&2\\\\1&2&1\\\\1&1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&2\\\\2&0&4\\\\-1&1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\)","apartados":["(1 p.) Calcula, si existen, la matriz inversa de \\(A\\) y la de \\(B\\).","(1,5 p.) Resuelve la ecuación matricial \\(AX+B=A+I\\), donde \\(I\\) denota la matriz identidad de orden 3."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&1&2\\\\1&2&1\\\\1&1&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(2+1+2\\bigr)-\\bigl(4+1+1\\bigr)\\]\\[=-1\\]<p>Como \\(|A|\\neq0\\), existe la inversa: \\(A^{-1}=\\dfrac1{|A|}(\\operatorname{Adj}A)^t\\).</p>\\[\\operatorname{Adj}A=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0 & -1\\\\1 & -1 & 0\\\\-3 & 1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow A^{-1}=-\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 1 & -3\\\\0 & -1 & 1\\\\-1 & 0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1 & -1 & 3\\\\0 & 1 & -1\\\\1 & 0 & -1\\end{pmatrix}\\]<p>En \\(B\\) la 2.ª fila es el doble de la 1.ª, así que \\(|B|=0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si dos filas de una matriz son proporcionales, su determinante es 0.</i>: \\(B\\) no tiene inversa.</p><div class='res'>\\(A^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1 & -1 & 3\\\\0 & 1 & -1\\\\1 & 0 & -1\\end{pmatrix}\\); \\(B\\) no tiene inversa</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[AX=A+I-B\\iff X=A^{-1}(A+I-B)=I+A^{-1}(I-B)\\]\\[I-B=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & -2\\\\-2 & 1 & -4\\\\1 & -1 & 0\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad A^{-1}(I-B)=\\begin{pmatrix}-1 & -1 & 3\\\\0 & 1 & -1\\\\1 & 0 & -1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & -2\\\\-2 & 1 & -4\\\\1 & -1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}5 & -4 & 6\\\\-3 & 2 & -4\\\\-1 & 1 & -2\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[X=I+\\begin{pmatrix}5 & -4 & 6\\\\-3 & 2 & -4\\\\-1 & 1 & -2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}6 & -4 & 6\\\\-3 & 3 & -4\\\\-1 & 1 & -1\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}6 & -4 & 6\\\\-3 & 3 & -4\\\\-1 & 1 & -1\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"inv","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"ecmat","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_5.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-5-8","n":8,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Dados los puntos \\(A(2,1,-1)\\) y \\(B(-2,3,1)\\) y la recta \\(r\\) definida por las ecuaciones \\(\\begin{cases}x-y-z=-1\\\\3x-2z=-5\\end{cases}\\), halla las coordenadas de un punto de la recta \\(r\\) que equidiste de los puntos \\(A\\) y \\(B\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Paramétricas de \\(r\\): de la 2.ª, \\(z=\\frac{3x+5}2\\). Tomando \\(x=-1+2\\lambda\\): \\(z=1+3\\lambda\\), y de la 1.ª, \\(y=x-z+1=-1-\\lambda\\). Así \\(r\\equiv(-1+2\\lambda,\\,-1-\\lambda,\\,1+3\\lambda)\\).</p><p>Un punto \\(P(x,y,z)\\) equidista de \\(A\\) y \\(B\\) si \\(|\\overrightarrow{AP}|^2=|\\overrightarrow{BP}|^2\\):</p>\\[(x-2)^2+(y-1)^2+(z+1)^2=(x+2)^2+(y-3)^2+(z-1)^2\\iff-8x+4y+4z=8\\iff-2x+y+z=2\\]<p>(Es el plano mediador de \\(AB\\).) Sustituyendo el punto de \\(r\\):</p>\\[-2(-1+2\\lambda)+(-1-\\lambda)+(1+3\\lambda)=2\\iff2-2\\lambda=2\\iff\\lambda=0\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":66,\"el\":8,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-3.0,0.0,-2.0],[1.0,-2.0,4.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.0,-2.0,4.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[2,1,-1],[-1,-1,1],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"line\",[-2,3,1],[-1,-1,1],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"line\",[2,1,-1],[-2,3,1],\"#94a3b8\",1.2,false],[\"pt\",[2,1,-1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-2,3,1],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-1,-1,1],\"P\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m08r5b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m08r5b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m08r5b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m08r5b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='196.6' y1='246.0' x2='26.0' y2='18.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='32.0' y='18.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='37.7' y1='223.8' x2='111.3' y2='132.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='208.4' y1='149.3' x2='111.3' y2='132.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='37.7' y1='223.8' x2='208.4' y2='149.3' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.2'/><circle cx='37.7' cy='223.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='44.7' y='217.8' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='208.4' cy='149.3' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='215.4' y='143.3' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='111.3' cy='132.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='118.3' y='126.0' font-weight='700'>P</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='9.4' y2='270.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='1.3' y='275.2' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='30.5' y2='272.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='29.8' y='276.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='252.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(P(-1,-1,1)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(|AP|^2=9+4+4=17\\) y \\(|BP|^2=1+16+0=17\\) ✓.</i></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"dist","apartados":""},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"lug","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_5.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"}]}